
>> Size := Objekt nĳ.
Size by: ['is:'] dwaan: { :getal
	getal by: ['+'] dwaan: { :getal
		>> unit := getal kwalifikaasje.
		>> factor := 1.
		
		unit
		gefal: ['inch'] dwaan: { factor := 0.0833. }. <- sels + (getal * factor).
	}. <- getal.
}.

# This size number can be used as follows:

>> plank := Size is: 6 foot.
>> edge := Size is: 50 inch.

# This will show as: 10.165
Utfier skriuwe: plank + edge, nije-rigel.
